    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "For the director of music. A psalm of David.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The heavens declare the glory of God;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the skies proclaim the work of his hands.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Day after day they pour forth speech;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "night after night they reveal knowledge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have no speech, they use no words;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "no sound is heard from them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet their voice",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "goes out into all the earth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "their words to the ends of the world.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "PSA 19:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "In the heavens God has pitched a tent for the sun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is like a bridegroom coming out of his chamber,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "like a champion rejoicing to run his course.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It rises at one end of the heavens",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and makes its circuit to the other;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nothing is deprived of its warmth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The law of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.19.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.19.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is perfect,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "refreshing the soul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "PSA 19:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The statutes of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.19.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.19.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "are trustworthy,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "making wise the simple.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The precepts of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.19.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.19.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "are right,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "giving joy to the heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "PSA 19:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The commands of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.19.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.19.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "are radiant,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "giving light to the eyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The fear of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.19.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.19.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is pure,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "enduring forever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "PSA 19:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The decrees of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.19.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.19.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "are firm,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and all of them are righteous.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are more precious than gold,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "than much pure gold;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "PSA 19:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they are sweeter than honey,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "than honey from the honeycomb.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By them your servant is warned;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "in keeping them there is great reward.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But who can discern their own errors?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 19:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Forgive my hidden faults.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
